msc_proxy_d7_unverified_p1e-3.stim is an unmodified performance proxy from
https://github.com/haoliri0/SymFT_Test
revision 9ec5790322f93140e78bdb6d6620a2a43eceba0b,
benchmark/circuit/msc_proxy_d7_unverified_p1e-3.stim.
The upstream README explicitly says this is NOT a validated distance-7
double-cat cultivation protocol. Preserve that qualification in reported results.

